//! Skill stats PoB reads into no output (Phase 6, P6-6a; plan decision
//! 9): a skill gem's stats PoB v2.67.2 reads only through stat maps (a
//! skill's own `statMap` and `Data/SkillStatMap.lua`,
//! `Modules/CalcActiveSkill.lua`), and these no stat map names. No module
//! names them, and no item mod or passive carries them (PoB reads item and
//! passive lines by their text), so they act on nothing in PoB.
//!
//! Generated by `tools/oracle/sweep/skill_stats.py` from PoB v2.67.2 and
//! the unmapped gem stats of the skill sweep, the public builds, and the
//! corpus (`docs/phase-6/skill-data.md`). Each is `NoEffect`
//! ([`super::mapping::Poe1Mapping`]). A stat the game reads that PoB does
//! not is a difference shared with the oracle: none is known.

